{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24842","headline":"南海苦雨寄赠王四侍御 · 杨衡","name":"南海苦雨寄赠王四侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎风杂海气，暑雨每成霖。\n涂泥亲杖屦，苔藓渍衣襟。\n念近剧怀远，涉浅定知深。\n暗沟夜滴滴，荒庭昼霪霪。\n折简展离旷，理迳俟招寻。\n处阴诚多惨，况乃触隅禽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}